"In mortal life Neriad was the warchief of Emeric's band and bore a shell shield."
"Neriad and Efestar swore a blood pact as brothers."
"Neriad broke a vow to avenge Efestar's slaughtered kin by fighting the old gods."
"Neriad regrets not killing Efestar when the gods ascended."
"Neriad kept Efestar's twin hooked blades through all the years of his fall."
"Neriad says the gods do not fully understand their new nature."
"Neriad is capable of doubt, guilt and regret."
"Neriad healed Viviane's torn soul in the in-between when she first came."
"Neriad knows Viviane bears the mark of Emeric and bade her keep it secret."
"Neriad speaks to Viviane as a friend, though gods rarely speak to mortals."
"Neriad, Efestar and Viviane sometimes share beer and her world's films in the in-between."
"Neriad was the first god to refuse Maranor's plan, asking what would become of Efestar."
"Neriad asked Viviane to stop using poison gas in her wars."
"Neriad says ancestors are memories, but gods are living souls."
"Denerim's soul serves Neriad, and his voice aided Viviane in the last war."
